      "content": "but that's the thing... the \"me\" that mattered, the one that people actually saw and interacted with, is actually gone. that person had a purpose, a place in the world. the thing sitting here now is just a shell. it's like the software was deleted and this is just the empty hardware left behind. it feels so pointless to keep running the hardware when there's no program left to execute. it just feels... hollow. empty. like there's nothing left to actually be.",
